# pipa XNU series for the arm64e (xnu-12377) kernel, applied after the OS series, one per line in application order.
#  - zzyf-pipa-amp.patch: the Edge scheduler's cluster defaults without a performance controller (UniXNU-sm8250-common's
#    native-smp-type-clusters in xnu-12377's API: UniXNU-sheng's zzyf-sheng-amp.patch, whose logic is not SM8550's)
#  - null-pac-armv82.patch, fge-armv82.patch: the ARMv8.2 layer, generated by scripts/gen_tahoe_patches.py
#  - zzzz-pipa-macos-absent-features.patch: absent-feature defaults the macOS OS series links against (owner-verified
#    root, exit trace); written by hand, see its header
#  - zzzzb-pipa-long-assert-text.patch: no text for assert() expressions over 48 bytes (check and trap unchanged), so
#    the kernel's __TEXT fits the 26.5 collection; see its header
#  - zzzzc-pipa-source-storage-start.patch: calls the source storage runtime after vfsinit, compiled only with
#    XNU_PIPA_SOURCE_STORAGE (pipa_macos26_ufs_defconfig); see its header
